A practical reading of the two halves:

  - the ledger / hash-chain / replay code and this MCP server
    →  Apache-2.0: learn from it, fork it, ship it.
  - the story compiled into the kernel artifact (the card pool, the script,
    the endings)  →  mine. Copying it is copyright infringement, and the
    golden chain heads make any such copy checkable against the originals.
